# ---- Raw source data (154 MB, not in version control) -----------------------
# The capstone dataset is supplied by the course. Download it and drop the
# files into these folders before running the pipeline. See README.md.
data/*.csv
stream/*.log

# Keep the folder structure and the documentation in those directories.
!data/.gitkeep
!stream/README_topic.md

